      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Your truck is the wrecking ball. Pump with movement controls; ACTION gives
    a short reel tug on cooldown. Physical impacts damage tower supports and can
    bring upper floors down. Each structural module scores only once; loose rubble
    cannot farm points. Three simultaneous 60-second rounds, most destruction points
    wins. Tied leaders play a 20-second extra round. The siren locks scores BEFORE
    the automatic demolition finale. Finale destruction awards no points. A genuine
    stuck truck is rehung with three seconds of lost control. Escape pauses all bays;
    reconnect preserves current state.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
